    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="021051db-e6b4-523b-adc7-c1c19a7c211a" activityNameId="d3dc0c39-99ad-5f8e-a7fc-3cb454e30ed8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, PP-HM pipe, SN 16, DN 600, profile 1</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, PP-HM pipe, SN 16, DN 600, profile 1
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: e438a77f-19c1-42dd-8e89-233fd0bb52a3
This process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with PP-HM pipe. SN 16, DN 300, profile 1 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with PP-HM pipe, DN 300, profile 1. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: SN 16, DN 600, profile 1 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. PP-HM pipe, ID 572 mm, outer diameter 630 mm, wall thickness 28 mm, 50 kg/m, 930 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e438a77f-19c1-42dd-8e89-233fd0bb52a3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
